## CONVERSATION

<USER_REQUEST>
A young woman is diagnosed with haemoglobin S/β+ thalassaemia compound heterozygosity. What are the potential risks for her partner and their fetus if the partner is a carrier of either β thalassaemia or haemoglobin S?
</USER_REQUEST>

