$d = 20(20.21) + \frac{1}{2}(-9.8)(20.21)^2$
$d = 404 -4.9(404.2241) = 404 - 19.0011009 = 20.21$

Another formula is:
$d = \frac{v_0^2}{2|a|}$
$d = \frac{(20)^2}{2(9.8)} = \frac{400}{19.00} = 20.2122...$

